\mathop{\mathrm{\mathop{\mathrm{V}}}}[Y]  = \textcolor{blue}{\mathop{\mathrm{E}}\sb*{ \mathop{\mathrm{E}}(Y^2 \mid W) - \left\{ * \right\}{\mathop{\mathrm{E}}\p*{Y \mid W}}^2}}
